        "notes": "# \ud83e\uddff Items\n\nThe 2 first round you'll take WP. It the best way to make money early game. You'll have to choose between 2 powers:\n\n-  [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) if you have some effects to cleanse (Typically Junker Queen, Ashe, Ana, ...)\n-  [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) if not\n\nIMO these 2 powers are equivalent to farm money in early game.\n\nThe best early items for survival are  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)  and  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da). In our case you'll take  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) most of the time because you can heal yourself easily as Kiriko. Take  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) if you took  [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) and you feel like you'll get poked a lot.\n\n# \ud83d\udd2b Playstyle\n\n**MONEY IS THE MOST IMPORTANT. YOU DON'T WANT TO FOCUS ON THE WIN THE 2 FIRST ROUNDS**\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f Stay in backline and focus your heals on your tank. Healing on the tank is easy money. Try to cleanse effects and don't forget to use your kunai between your heals (Healing gives more money but if you can get a kill participation, you'll get more). And the most important, DON'T DIE\n\n*Why DON'T DIE ???? Unlike classic Overwatch, you'll give ultimate charge AND money to your oponent if you die. Moreover, you'll loose a lot of money because you won't get money from healing or kill participations.*",
