        "notes": "# \ud83e\uddff Items\n\nWhat do we want? CDR! So buy  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). If you can't, as always, focus on AP.\n\nFor the power, take  [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) ONLY IF THERE IS SOMETHING TO CLEANSE or this power is useless. Typically if you play against Juno+Mercy+Zarya+Genji+Soldier, it will be useless. Think about  [Crossing Guard](item_bb5252fd-fc6b-4dce-a60a-21b0a0add68f) instead.\n\nAt this point of the game, survival items or no longer needed. Indeed your shield + heal from suzu are really strong. Keep spamming your TP and Suzu\n\n# \ud83d\udd2b Playstyle\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f If you took  [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68), focus your Suzu on cleansing effects (such as, Ashe's dynamite, Ana's nade, ...). Note that it works against  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) (hello Moira).",
